## Difficulty
@@DIFFICULTY@@ The scene is dynamic (`scripts/task_dynamics.toml`: @@DYNAMIC_WHY@@), and in standard-realtime mode time does not stop: once an attempt's clock starts the venue's timed events happen whatever the agent does, so it has to plan or stream the robot's rows from a program of its own, with no simulator and no state, and @@RT_RESET_BUDGET@@ resets (only the last attempt is graded).

